<title>JAPAN: Five western-Japan credit unions to merge - official.</title>
<headline>Five western-Japan credit unions to merge - official.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five credit unions in western Japan will merge to help out one of their number, the financially troubled Chogin Osaka Shinyo Kumiai, a senior Osaka prefectural government official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The five unions are expected to announce a merger later in the day, he said.</p>
</text>
